You decided to bet on the element of surprise and jumped out from the cover. You rushed away by long jumps. The police men held back because of the suddenness, but in a few seconds gunfire sounded. Suddenly, the moon disappeared behind the clouds. You were lucky that the street lights were out and pitch black darkness covered the neighborhood. You almost managed to reach a safe place, when suddenly one of the bullets hit you.  You squealed in agony, and after covering a few more yards, dropped on the spot. 
"We need to check it out. Everybody, come with me," ordered one of the policemen. Moving extremely cautiously and holding their guns ready to shoot, the cops approached the place you fell. 
"It's clear, guys! There is some naked redneck here. Maybe we hit him while were shooting at the beast? Call an ambulance."
"Where did he come from?"
"I bet he visited somebody's wife and her husband came home early. So he jumped off the balcony."
"What's there on his neck?"
"Looks like a cell phone."
"Poor devil. If I were in his shoes, I'd have grabbed my shorts." 
The ambulance arrived quite fast. The doctors verified the death of the victim, then took the body and drove it to the morgue.